sentences.l:
but you, a third man, name,
who still alive is held back on the broad sea,
or has died;

but him I saw on an island, a swelling tear shedding,
in the halls of the nymph Calypso, who by constraint
holds him;

no snow is there, nor much winter storm, nor ever rain,
but always, of the West Wind shrilly blowing, the breezes
Oceanus sends up to give men refreshment;

for you rule over a plain,
a wide one, in which much clover is, and galingale,
and wheat and spelt, and broad-growing white barley.

and gave it to me Phaedimus the hero,
king of the Sidonians, when his own house sheltered
me there, on my way home;
